# Legacy: More Config: navigation and text selection
# Related screen: More Config: swipe/tap navigation, direction and text-selection toggles.
# Related path (context only; these entries are unused): Open a book > open a panel > More config... .

msgid "Allow touch and hold on text inside zoomed panels to select text and trigger OCR-based dictionary lookups. On by default; turn off if the OCR word detection misfires often on your comics."
msgstr "允许长按放大分镜中的文字以选择文本并触发 OCR 查词。默认开启；若 OCR 文字检测频繁误判可关闭。"

msgid "Swipe left/right to move between panels. Turning this off leaves panel navigation to taps, buttons, or physical page-turn keys only."
msgstr "左右滑动切换分镜。关闭后仅能通过点击、按钮或物理翻页键导航。"

msgid "Tap the left or right edge of the screen to move to the previous or next panel, instead of only showing/hiding the controls. Which side advances depends on reading mode: right side in Comic mode, left side in Manga mode. Only active at standard zoom."
msgstr "点击屏幕左右边缘切换分镜，而非仅显示/隐藏控件。前进方向取决于阅读模式：美漫为右侧，日漫为左侧。仅在标准缩放下生效。"

msgid "Text Selection"
msgstr "文字选择"

msgid "Touch & hold text selection in zoom [EXPERIMENTAL]"
msgstr "放大时长按选词 [实验性]"

msgid "Use this if panel navigation feels reversed on your device. It changes swipe direction only, not panel order."
msgstr "若设备上分镜导航方向相反可启用。仅改变滑动方向，不改变分镜顺序。"

# Legacy: More Config: double-page spreads
# Related screen: More Config: Rotate spreads / Remove spread fold line and their values.
# Related path (context only; these entries are unused): Panel viewer > More config... > Rotate spreads / Remove spread fold line.

msgid "Auto-rotate double-page spreads"
msgstr "自动旋转跨页"

msgid "Rotate a wide full-page image inside the panel viewer to fit a portrait screen. Manual image rotation takes priority; device orientation is unchanged."
msgstr "在分镜查看器中将宽幅全页图像旋转以适应竖屏。手动图像旋转优先；设备方向不变。"

msgid "Remove the fold line from double-page spreads"
msgstr "移除跨页折痕线"

msgid "Some scans join the two pages of a spread with a black strip. Remove that strip and join the two halves, on the reading page and in the panel viewer. When a page is zoomed in so far that it is rendered in parts, the strip stays."
msgstr "部分扫描件用黑色条带连接跨页的两页。移除条带并拼接两半，在阅读页和分镜查看器中均生效。当页面放大到分块渲染时，条带保留。"

msgid "Rotate double-page spreads by a quarter turn so they fill a portrait screen. In the panel viewer the whole-spread image is rotated and the device stays as it is. While reading, the screen is rotated when a page turn lands on a spread and restored on the next normal page, in the same direction."
msgstr "将跨页旋转 90 度以填满竖屏。分镜查看器中旋转整个跨页图像，设备方向不变。阅读时，翻到跨页自动旋转屏幕，翻到普通页时以相同方向恢复。"

msgid "In the panel viewer"
msgstr "仅分镜查看器"

msgid "In the panel viewer and while reading"
msgstr "分镜查看器及阅读时"

msgid "While reading"
msgstr "阅读时"

# Legacy: Advanced options: reader preferences and diagnostics
# Related screen: Panels+ reader menu: per-book settings, native PDF text, pre-rendering, edge gestures and debug logging.
# Related path (context only; these entries are unused): Panel viewer > More config... > Open advanced options; or top menu > Tools > Panels+.

msgid "Swipe vertically within the left 25% of the screen to zoom in (swipe up) or zoom out (swipe down), similar to Kobo's edge gesture. Only active at standard zoom."
msgstr "在屏幕左侧 25% 区域内纵向滑动以放大（上滑）或缩小（下滑），类似 Kobo 的边缘手势。仅在标准缩放下生效。"

msgid "Performance"
msgstr "性能"

msgid "Render the next panel while you read the current one, so swiping to it is instant. Skipped automatically when the device is low on memory."
msgstr "阅读当前分镜时预先渲染下一分镜，使滑动切换无延迟。设备内存不足时自动跳过。"

